            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Measuring a deal against the $2,100 reference price</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">Horizon sells the 7.0 AT at its sale price every day, and codes often take it lower. A discount quoted from $2,100 is not a saving. Compare against the best code price you have seen and the delivered total.</p>
