              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">Horizon does not publish one for the 7.0 AT. The 3.0 HP or CHP in listings and reviews comes from reviewers, so do not use it to rank the 7.0 AT against another brand’s rating. Use the lifetime motor warranty instead.</p>
