            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Planning to use a strap and an app through the treadmill together</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">Reviewers report that the treadmill’s heart-rate-monitor-only mode cannot run alongside a training app. Pair the strap to the app, or use an Apple Watch through GymKit, and test your setup within the 30-day guarantee.</p>
