              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">Horizon says the 7.0 AT is not GFCI-compatible and wants a dedicated circuit with no extension cord or surge strip. Check the outlet before delivery day, because it is a common cause of a treadmill that cuts out.</p>
